129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (The offline pipeline runs once to build system artefacts: job postings are collected, skills extracted, archetypes clustered, descriptions encoded, the FAISS index built and salary ranges pre-computed. The online pipeline runs per candidate query in approximately 30 seconds, with each tool's output feeding into the next step's reasoning. The reasoning trace  - the agent's full Thought-Action-Observation log - is included in every career report, making every decision visible and auditable.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
